  "steps": [
    "To a pan add 2 milk buns, 700ml whole milk, ⅓ cup cocoa powder (30g), ⅓ cup custard powder (30g), ¼ dark chocolate chips (40g), ½ cup condensed milk (150g), Then break the buns and mix it nicely.",
    "Cook it on low flame while stirring continuously until the mixture combines into a clumpy form. (It takes like 5 min)",
    "Let this mixture cool down, Add 2 scoops of protein powder, blend it to a smooth and runny texture. (For the video, I divided the mixture into two equal batches and blended only one batch.)",
    "Transfer this to desired ramekins or bowls and refrigerate for a few hours or overnight.",
    "Finally, when it’s set - dust with cocoa powder. And it’s ready!"
  ],
